flowchart TD
    Start([Webhook Issue Detected]) --> CheckSymptom{What's wrong?}

    CheckSymptom -->|Not received| NotReceived[Webhook not arriving]
    CheckSymptom -->|Rejected| Rejected[Webhook rejected 403]
    CheckSymptom -->|Duplicate| Duplicate[Duplicate webhooks]
    CheckSymptom -->|Out of order| OutOfOrder[Out-of-order delivery]

    %% Not Received Path
    NotReceived --> CheckProvider[Check provider<br/>dashboard]
    CheckProvider --> ProviderSent{Provider shows<br/>webhook sent?}
    ProviderSent -->|No| ProviderFail[Provider delivery<br/>failure]
    ProviderSent -->|Yes| CheckFirewall[Check firewall<br/>and network]

    ProviderFail --> ContactProvider[Contact provider<br/>support]
    ContactProvider --> VerifyEndpoint[Verify webhook<br/>endpoint URL]

    CheckFirewall --> FirewallOK{Traffic reaching<br/>server?}
    FirewallOK -->|No| OpenFirewall[Open firewall rules<br/>for provider IPs]
    FirewallOK -->|Yes| CheckAppLogs[Check application<br/>logs]

    CheckAppLogs --> InLogs{Webhook in<br/>app logs?}
    InLogs -->|No| AppNotReceiving[App not receiving<br/>webhooks]
    InLogs -->|Yes| ProcessingFailed[Webhook received<br/>but processing failed]

    %% Rejected Path
    Rejected --> CheckRejectionReason[Check rejection<br/>logs]
    CheckRejectionReason --> RejectionType{Rejection<br/>reason?}

    RejectionType -->|Invalid signature| SigFailure[Signature verification<br/>failed]
    RejectionType -->|Timestamp expired| TimestampIssue[Timestamp outside<br/>tolerance]
    RejectionType -->|Rate limited| RateLimited[Rate limit exceeded]
    RejectionType -->|Replay detected| ReplayAttack[Replay attack<br/>prevented]

    SigFailure --> GetSecret[Get current webhook<br/>secret from provider]
    GetSecret --> CompareSecret{Does secret<br/>match config?}
    CompareSecret -->|No| UpdateSecretEnv[Update .env with<br/>correct secret]
    CompareSecret -->|Yes| CheckRotation{Secret recently<br/>rotated?}
    CheckRotation -->|Yes| AddRotationSecret[Add old secret to<br/>WEBHOOK_SECRET_ROTATION]
    CheckRotation -->|No| ManualTest[Manually test<br/>signature generation]

    TimestampIssue --> CheckServerTime[Check server time<br/>with NTP]
    CheckServerTime --> TimeDrift{Time drift<br/>detected?}
    TimeDrift -->|Yes| SyncNTP[Sync with NTP:<br/>ntpdate time.nist.gov]
    TimeDrift -->|No| CheckTolerance[Check timestamp<br/>tolerance setting]

    RateLimited --> CheckRateLimit[Check rate limit<br/>configuration]
    CheckRateLimit --> TooLow{Limit too<br/>restrictive?}
    TooLow -->|Yes| IncreaseLimit[Increase rate limit<br/>or whitelist provider]
    TooLow -->|No| CheckAbuse[Investigate potential<br/>abuse]

    ReplayAttack --> CheckNonce[Check webhook ID<br/>in logs]
    CheckNonce --> LegitReplay{Legitimate<br/>retry?}
    LegitReplay -->|Yes| ClearNonceCache[Clear nonce cache<br/>for this webhook]
    LegitReplay -->|No| BlockSource[Block source IP<br/>if malicious]

    %% Duplicate Path
    Duplicate --> CheckIdempotency[Check idempotency<br/>key handling]
    CheckIdempotency --> HasIdempotency{Idempotency<br/>implemented?}
    HasIdempotency -->|No| ImplementIdempotency[Implement webhook ID<br/>tracking in Redis]
    HasIdempotency -->|Yes| CheckTTL{TTL appropriate?<br/>24 hours]
    CheckTTL -->|No| AdjustTTL[Adjust TTL to<br/>24-48 hours]
    CheckTTL -->|Yes| CheckProvider2[Provider retrying<br/>unnecessarily?]

    CheckProvider2 --> ConfigureRetry[Configure provider<br/>retry settings]

    %% Out of Order Path
    OutOfOrder --> CheckVersioning[Check version-based<br/>concurrency control]
    CheckVersioning --> HasVersioning{Using version<br/>numbers?}
    HasVersioning -->|No| AddVersioning[Add version column<br/>to payments table]
    HasVersioning -->|Yes| CheckIdempotent{Allowing idempotent<br/>transitions?}
    CheckIdempotent -->|No| AllowIdempotent[Allow same-state<br/>transitions]
    CheckIdempotent -->|Yes| CheckProgressive[Check progressive<br/>state detection]

    CheckProgressive --> ImplementProgressive[Ignore webhooks for<br/>already-reached states]

    %% Resolution paths
    UpdateSecretEnv --> RestartApp[Restart application]
    AddRotationSecret --> RestartApp
    SyncNTP --> VerifyTime[Verify time<br/>synchronized]
    IncreaseLimit --> RestartApp
    ClearNonceCache --> RetryWebhook[Retry webhook<br/>delivery]
    ImplementIdempotency --> DeployCode[Deploy code<br/>changes]
    AddVersioning --> DeployCode
    AllowIdempotent --> DeployCode
    ImplementProgressive --> DeployCode

    RestartApp --> TestWebhook[Test webhook<br/>delivery]
    VerifyTime --> TestWebhook
    RetryWebhook --> TestWebhook
    DeployCode --> TestWebhook
    ConfigureRetry --> TestWebhook

    TestWebhook --> Success{Webhooks<br/>working?}
    Success -->|Yes| Monitor[Monitor for<br/>recurrence]
    Success -->|No| Escalate[Escalate to<br/>engineering team]

    Monitor --> End([Issue Resolved])
    Escalate --> End

    style Start fill:#1e40af,stroke:#3b82f6,color:#fff
    style SigFailure fill:#dc2626,stroke:#ef4444,color:#fff
    style TimestampIssue fill:#f59e0b,stroke:#fbbf24,color:#000
    style RateLimited fill:#f59e0b,stroke:#fbbf24,color:#000
    style ReplayAttack fill:#dc2626,stroke:#ef4444,color:#fff
    style DeployCode fill:#059669,stroke:#10b981,color:#fff
    style Monitor fill:#059669,stroke:#10b981,color:#fff
    style End fill:#7c3aed,stroke:#8b5cf6,color:#fff
    style Escalate fill:#dc2626,stroke:#ef4444,color:#fff
